#v(20pt)
#only("3-")[- Divide by a power of ten. ➗]
#only("1")[
#voiceover("So quick summary: To convert a decimal to a fraction, first count the decimal places.")
]
#only("2")[
#voiceover("Then, remove the decimal point.")
]
#only("3")[
#voiceover("Next, divide by a one with zeros, one zero for each decimal place. And that's already it!")
